3:1. **Requester ≠ approver** (REQ-S10-016). Under the default policy the server rejects an approval by the requester, or by the requester's delegate acting for the requester. A configured exception
4:2. **Technical administrators are not business approvers** (REQ-S10-003, REQ-S06-010).
8:3. **Finance validation is exclusive to FIN** (REQ-PB-013). This holds even where the Business Owner remains accountable (M0211).
9:4. **Stale approvals are rejected.** An approval must reference the current submitted version (REQ-S10-017).
10:5. **Automation never approves.** Timers escalate, route and remind. They never set approve or validate outcomes (REQ-S10-019, REQ-S12-026).
11:6. **One accountable per deliverable.** The exception is a documented governance rule; "A/R" counts as one accountable (REQ-S10-009).
12:7. **Gate approvals** default to SP. The playbook's gate table (B0023) names no approver, and B0018 gives the Sponsor "approves major trade-offs". Where a T11 decision (B0099) matches what a gate d
17:8. **Waivers** cannot be approved by the requester or by ADM (REQ-S04-013).

$ glossary sample
| Champion | سفير التغيير | مناصر التغيير | "سفير" (ambassador) stresses broadcasting messages, which B0116 explicitly says a champion does more than. |
| Stage gate | بوابة المرحلة | A business decision point with a decision question and required evidence (G1–G6). It is not an engineering delivery gate (DG0–DG7). | B0023 |
| Executive Sponsor | الراعي التنفيذي | Owns enterprise outcome, removes constraints, approves major trade-offs. | B0018 |
| Finance / Value Office | الإدارة المالية / مكتب القيمة | Validates baseline, benefit logic, value realization. | B0018 |
| Champion | مناصر التغيير | Person in impacted teams who surfaces constraints and shapes decisions, not only broadcasts messages. | B0116 |
| North Star | النجم الشمالي (الغاية العليا) | Concise description of the desired future business state. | B0048 |
| Target Operating Model (TOM) | نموذج التشغيل المستهدف | How the business will operate after the transformation, across ten dimensions; not a project portfolio. | B0056, B0059 |
| Double counting | الاحتساب المزدوج | Counting the same benefit more than once; prevented by unique owner, baseline, formula and financial link. | B0088 |
| RAG | حالة أحمر / كهرماني / أخضر | Red/Amber/Green status. | B0095 |
| RACI (T12) | مصفوفة المسؤوليات (منفّذ/مساءَل/مستشار/مُطّلع) | Responsible, Accountable, Consulted, Informed per deliverable and role. | B0101 |
| Adoption | التبنّي | The organization actually using the new way of working, managed as an outcome. | B0105 |
| Realized value | القيمة المحقَّقة | Benefit actually achieved and evidenced. | B0123 |
| BAU handover | التسليم إلى العمليات الاعتيادية | Transfer of ownership, controls and control cadence to BAU owners. | B0023, B0101, B0121 |
